    "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat: introduce cognition-protocols-worker by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/1\n* ci: add ci-summary workflow by @msardara in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/5\n* feat: renaming OXP -> SCOPE by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/2\n* feat(docs): update docs by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/6\n* fix: fix for deploy doc workflow by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/7\n* fix: update docs to have scope at the root of the github pages by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/8\n* feat: update docs by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/9\n* fix(backend): cognitive failure worker improvements by @tfeltin in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/4\n* feat: adding docker compose + updates for the helm chart by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/10\n* docs: renamed Home -> Overview by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/11\n* fix(normalization): fix state trajectory continuity issue by @tfeltin in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/12\n* First tutorial: ingesting your first trace by @tfeltin in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/13\n* feat: update package names by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/15\n* fix(api): fix api topology endpoint in cases where grpah not present by @tfeltin in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/14\n* fix(docker-compose): update SCOPE_VERSION by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/16\n* docs(instrumentation): add docs for insight-module-for-agentic-systems for instrumenting Openclaw based agentic systems by @91pavan in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/17\n* feat: ioc screens restructure by @psterpu-c in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/18\n* Performance fixes + updated docs by @tfeltin in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/19\n* Feat/lower deployment footprint by @tfeltin in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/21\n* fix(codeowners): fix group by @tfeltin in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/22\n* fix: update the name of the charts by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/23\n* fix(helm): update workflow by @Castorche in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/24\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Castorche made their first contribution in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/1\n* @msardara made their first contribution in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/5\n* @tfeltin made their first contribution in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/4\n* @91pavan made their first contribution in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/17\n* @psterpu-c made their first contribution in https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/pull/18\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ioc-project/scope/commits/helm-v1.0.0",
